   plant, Unpl. Del. Csts = balance
4. Simulate -&gt; CHECK: exit | PARK: park | POST: post

MIRO_MODE = CHECK (default, nothing saved) | PARK | POST
Run:  run_miro.bat      or      robot --outputdir output tasks\miro_posting.robot</doc>
